lowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T11:43:50Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T11:49:50Z","body":"exporting to the project folder itself is also not generally a good idea, please try exporting to a directory outside the project to test\n\nEncryption shouldn't matter as it will still try to load the pck, so if it succeeds in the project folder it doesn't seem likely to be related to encryption (unless it picks the project over the pck in that case)\n\nAlso make sure you are using export templates of the right version, and run with verbose mode `game.exe --verbose`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3442706512/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3442775524","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111987#issuecomment-3442775524","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111987","id":3442775524,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NNJXk","user":{"login":"Franfyfoo","id":127937678,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6Asjg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/127937678?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.gith